,\n            \"feedback\": \"Improved understanding of polynomial functions.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"feedback_reports\": [\n        \"Student S123 responded positively to hands-on activities; incorporated more manipulative-based lessons.\",\n        \"Student S456 benefitted from one-on-one tutoring sessions; scheduled more individual time.\"\n    ]\n}"}
